Subject: [PATCH 11234/11362] Log the outer-loop supervision session in the
 turn log

The turn log carried rows for every subagent this session dispatched but none
for the supervision work that dispatched them. Per-turn Start/End times were not
captured while the session ran, so the row states that plainly and does not
reconstruct them: a fabricated cycle time is the defect this file exists to
prevent, and an honest gap is worth more than a plausible number.

Two earlier readings of this file in-session were both wrong -- "one entry for
the whole session" and "the log stopped in June" -- because the head of the file
holds historical sections and the current rows are appended at the tail.

